    503  43fb							; ---------------------------------------------------------
    504  43fb							; throne: the throne room, each frame of the game. The
    505  43fb							; crown on the throne: the blade breaks it, VICTORY
    506  43fb							; (CROWN_POINTS, the first byte of the score, and
    507  43fb							; ENERGY_POINTS for each unit of energy left). The King:
    508  43fb							; - after a blow he flashes for KHIT_FRAMES, and no blow
    509  43fb							;   counts; otherwise a blade on his head (his first
    510  43fb							;   KING_HEAD lines, where the venom flies) is a blow
    511  43fb							;   (KHIT_BCD points), and the KING_HITS-th beats him: the
    512  43fb							;   crown takes his place (KING_BCD points), the venom is
    513  43fb							;   gone;
    514  43fb							; - his bite: their boxes meet and no wound is counting
    515  43fb							;   (BITE_DAMAGE);
    516  43fb							; - the venom, while it flies: VEN_INT pixels a frame and
    517  43fb							;   one more when its fraction carries, on the lines of his
    518  43fb							;   mouth; it is gone past its free pixels (VSPAN: stone,
    519  43fb							;   the edge) or on Sir Roderick: parried by the shield if
    520  43fb							;   it comes from the side he faces and he is not thrusting
    521  43fb							;   (he shows the parry for PARRY_FRAMES), else a wound
    522  43fb							;   (VENOM_DAMAGE) unless one is counting;
    523  43fb							; - otherwise he goes a step of 2 lines (when the fraction
    524  43fb							;   of KSTEP_FRAC carries) towards the top line that puts
    525  43fb							;   his mouth at Sir Roderick's middle (ky + 2, kept between
    526  43fb							;   KING_T0 and KING_T1); when the time before a spit is
    527  43fb							;   over and he is there, he spits towards Sir Roderick's
    528  43fb							;   side: the venom starts beside him, and the time before
    529  43fb							;   the next spit is shorter the more blows he has had
    530  43fb							;   (SPIT).
