    407  737a							; p1_bands: what player 1 shows. Band A (above the
    408  737a							; seam, or the whole room): the thing of the room and the
    409  737a							; guard of the band (the second guard with a seam, else
    410  737a							; the first), each when it is there (the gate goes once
    411  737a							; open, a guard once killed); both in turn: the thing in
    412  737a							; even frames, the guard in odd ones (the flicker; they
    413  737a							; share lines); neither: the empty figure. Band B: the
    414  737a							; first guard, or the empty figure when it is dead (its
    415  737a							; column, in the coarse delay and the fine move of the
    416  737a							; seam, comes from things.asm, after it crawls).
    417  737a							; A guard stunned by a first blow blinks.
    418  737a							; In the throne room: p1_throne.
